{
  "about": "Failed banks Upmore matches old bank names against (packages/domain/91-unclaimed.js; owner card M2-UNCLAIMED-10). Each entry is a row of the FDIC Failed Bank List. fdic.gov does not resolve from the build container, so each row was checked through web search results on 2026-10-12 that quote the FDIC list or the FDIC's own bank page, and agreed with at least one other source (checked_how says which). deposits says what the FDIC said happened to deposits: all, substantially_all, insured (insured deposits only), or unknown (not stated in the sources found; the answer then sends the person to the FDIC page). closed_on is a date, or a month when sources disagree on the day. ambiguous marks a name many healthy banks share: it is never matched from the person's rows by name alone and is asked about by city. Re-check against https://www.fdic.gov/bank-failures/failed-bank-list monthly; past fresh_days the list is said to may have newer failures.",
